    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nUnique Serviced 0.71-Acre Property With Outbuildings, Concrete Yard & Countryside Views Less Than 10 Minutes From Tullamore\n\nDNG Kelly Duncan is delighted to bring to the market this unusual and highly versatile serviced property at Annagharvey, Tullamore, Co. Offaly, occupying a substantial site extending to approximately 0.71 acres in a peaceful rural setting less than ten minutes' drive from Tullamore town.\n\nOffered for sale as is, the property benefits from valuable existing infrastructure, with water and electricity available on site together with an existing septic tank. A portion of the property currently accommodates a mobile home, which is served by its own separate septic tank.\n\nThe site itself offers an attractive combination of hardstanding and green space. A substantial concrete yard provides excellent practical space and ample off-street parking, while the remainder is predominantly laid to lawn.\n\nExisting outbuildings further enhance the property's versatility and include a traditional hay barn-style shed with adjoining lean-to together with a separate block-built storage shed.\n\nAccess is through a gated entrance with block-built piers, while a block wall defines one aspect of the boundary and fencing encloses the remainder. The property enjoys a clearly defined site together with unobstructed views across the surrounding countryside.\n\nSituated along a quiet rural lane at Annagharvey, the property enjoys an appealing countryside setting while remaining less than ten minutes' drive from Tullamore and its extensive range of shops, schools, sporting facilities, restaurants, transport connections and everyday amenities.\n\nThe combination of 0.71 acres, existing services, substantial concrete yard, outbuildings, established boundaries and proximity to Tullamore creates an unusual offering with considerable versatility for its next owner.\n\nThe Property Is Being Offered For Sale As Is. Prospective Purchasers Should Satisfy Themselves As To The Suitability Of The Property For Their Intended Use And Any Planning Or Other Statutory Requirements That May Apply.\n\nViewing Is Strictly By Appointment With Sole Selling Agents DNG Kelly Duncan, Who Can Be Contacted On 057 93 25 050.\n\nDNG Kelly Duncan Your Trusted Real Estate Partner."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
