        "Content": "<ul><li> Substantial Site Extending To Approximately 0.71 Acres</li><li> Less Than 10 Minutes' Drive From Tullamore Town</li><li> Water And Electricity Available On Site</li><li> Mobile Home With Separate Septic Tank</li><li> Substantial Concrete Yard</li><li> Majority Of Grounds Laid To Lawn</li><li> Hay Barn-Style Shed With Adjoining Lean-To</li><li> Separate Block-Built Storage Shed</li><li> Ample Off-Street Parking</li><li> Gated Entrance With Block-Built Piers</li><li> Block-Built Boundary Wall To One Aspect</li><li> Remainder Of Site Defined By Fencing</li><li> Unobstructed Countryside Views</li><li> Quiet Rural Setting</li><li> Property Offered For Sale As Is</ul>"
